    {
      "type": "quote",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "left(90) \nspeed(10) \nl = 20 \nfor _ in range(4):  \n    forward(14*l)     \n    right(120)  \n\ncolor('red') \nup()\nfor x in range(0, 15):    \n    for y in range(0, 15):        \n        goto(x * l, y * l)         \n        dot('blue') \ndone()"
